# Testing Policy (Backend)

- Always write integration tests for new features and behavior changes, unless the user explicitly asks not to write tests.
- When changing existing functionality that already has integration coverage, update those tests so they match the new behavior.
- When adding a new feature, include integration test coverage as part of the work by default.
- Before finishing work that includes tests, run the full integration suite — not only the newly added tests.
